            "resource_heading": "Document Files",
            "resource_description": "<p data-block-key=\"cjwlg\">OpenStax provides DOCX files for each section of this textbook so instructors can more easily adapt and modify the content for their courses. For more robust customization support, OpenStax Technology Partners such as Cognella Custom, ExpertTA, Great River Learning, Kendall Hunt, and LAD Custom Publishing offer content customization options. To learn more, visit our <a href=\"https://openstax.org/partners\">Technology Partners</a> page and use the “Type” menu to filter for “Content customization.” These DOCX files may not be updated as frequently as the textbooks on the <a href=\"https://openstax.org/\">OpenStax website</a>, which remains the best and most accessible way for students to access our books. Once a file is downloaded, it won't automatically receive future updates.</p>",
