    "customization_form_heading": "Customization Form",
    "customization_form_subheading": "Please select the modules (up to 10), that you want to customize with Google Docs.",
    "customization_form_disclaimer": "<p data-block-key=\"zkdax\"><b>Disclaimer</b></p><p data-block-key=\"vcmjf\">The following features and functionality are not available to teachers and students using Google Docs customized content:</p><ul><li data-block-key=\"9qnbx\"><b>Errata updates</b>. OpenStax webview is updated at least twice yearly. Customized Google Docs will not receive these content updates.</li><li data-block-key=\"kwlwp\"><b>Access to study tools</b>. OpenStax webview has in-book search, highlighting, study guides, and more available for free. This functionality will not be available in Google Docs versions.</li><li data-block-key=\"xhzfe\"><b>Formatting.</b> Print books and webview have a specific design and structure format developed for those platforms. These functionalities are not available in the Google Docs versions.</li></ul>",
    "customization_form_next_steps": "<p data-block-key=\"ad6km\"><b>Next Steps</b></p><ol><li data-block-key=\"8eh5b\">Within two business days, you will receive an email for each module that you have requested access to customize.</li><li data-block-key=\"ljhz9\">The link provided in the email will be your own copy of the Google Doc that OpenStax generated for you.</li><li data-block-key=\"h97dr\">Once you have accessessed the document you can make the changes you desire and share with your students. We recommend using the \"Publish to the Web\" functionality under the file menu for sharing with students.</li></ol>",
